<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
  <title>Approved Answers · Welcome Call Center</title>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/adminnav') %>

  <main class="wide">
    <div class="page-head">
      <div>
        <h1>Approved Answers</h1>
        <p>The only answers the assistant may give when a homeowner asks a question. Everything else is deferred to a team member and logged.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="muted">
        These are the ONLY answers the assistant may give when a homeowner asks a question —
        anything not covered here is politely deferred to a team member and logged for review.
        Use the <code>Q:</code> / <code>A:</code> format, one blank line between entries.
        Keep answers short, factual, and pre-approved by your compliance team — remember,
        every answer is spoken on a recorded line.
      </p>
      <% if (saved) { %><div class="alert alert-success">Approved answers saved and synced to the voice assistant.</div><% } %>
      <% if (error) { %><div class="alert alert-error"><%= error %></div><% } %>
      <form method="post" action="/admin/faq" class="stack">
        <textarea name="faq" rows="20" class="code-area"><%= faq %></textarea>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save &amp; sync</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
